  "notes": "Casual spoken contraction of つまらない (boring). The ら sound is dropped, a very common pattern in casual Japanese.\n\nSIMILAR CONTRACTIONS:\n- わからない → わかんない\n- つまらない → つまんない\n- やらない → やんない\n- すまない → すまんない (less common)\n\nREGISTER:\nVery casual and common in everyday conversation, especially among younger speakers. Not appropriate in formal writing or polite speech — use つまらない instead.",
